        "content": {
          "content_type": "text",
          "parts": [
            "Got it. I pulled **everything that\u2019s explicitly listed in the Website Essentials Checklist** plus **all tools, platforms, and accounts mentioned in the Eric & Bethany weekly check-in meeting**, and organized them into a **single clean password master list format** you can drop straight into Google Sheets, ClickUp, or NordPass.\n\nBelow is the **structured password list**.  \nAnything marked \u26a0\ufe0f means credentials were referenced but **not fully defined yet** and should be filled in once confirmed.\n\n---\n\n## \ud83d\udd10 The Luxora Collective \u2013 Master Password & Access List\n\n### Core Website + Tech Stack\n| Program / App | Username / Email | Password | Login Link |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| WordPress | bethany@theluxoracollective.co | Login via IdentityAlchemy | https://wordpress.com |\n| Elementor Pro | mrsbethanygifford@gmail.com | LuxoraLady@2026 | https://elementor.com |\n| GoHighLevel (GHL) | eric@theluxoracollective.co | ThePines1974$ | https://www.gohighlevel.com |\n| Domain Provider (likely GoDaddy) | eric@66stllc.com | TDOH1974$ | https://www.godaddy.com |\n| Typeform | bethany@theluxoracollective.co | TLC@2026 | https://www.typeform.com |\n\n\ue200filecite\ue202turn0file1\ue201\n\n---\n\n### Google Workspace / Email Accounts\n| Account | Username | Password | Login Link |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Luxora Main Gmail | bethany@theluxoracollective.co | Luxora@2026 | https://mail.google.com |\n| Luxora Eric Email | eric@theluxoracollective.co | LuxoraGentleman@2026 | https://mail.google.com |\n| Luxora Support | support@theluxoracollective.co | LuxoraSupport@2026 | https://mail.google.com |\n\n\ue200filecite\ue202turn0file1\ue201\n\n---\n\n### Project Management & Communication\n| Program / App | Username / Email | Password | Login Link |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| ClickUp | \u26a0\ufe0f TBD (team setup in progress) | \u26a0\ufe0f TBD | https://clickup.com |\n| Slack | \u26a0\ufe0f Google Workspace login | \u26a0\ufe0f SSO | https://slack.com |\n| Google Drive | Workspace SSO | SSO | https://drive.google.com |\n\n\ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue201\n\n---\n\n### AI & Automation Tools\n| Program / App | Username / Email | Password | Login Link |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| ChatGPT | Bethany account | Saved locally | https://chat.openai.com |\n| Claude AI | \u26a0\ufe0f Pending team vs individual setup | \u26a0\ufe0f TBD | https://claude.ai |\n| Manus AI | \u26a0\ufe0f Eric account | \u26a0\ufe0f TBD | \u26a0\ufe0f TBD |\n| Gamma (Presentations) | \u26a0\ufe0f Bethany email | \u26a0\ufe0f TBD | https://gamma.app |\n\n\ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue201\n\n---\n\n### Marketing, Ads & Analytics\n| Program / App | Username / Email | Password | Login Link |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Meta Business Manager | \u26a0\ufe0f Connected via Facebook | SSO | https://business.facebook.com |\n| Google Ads | \u26a0\ufe0f Workspace SSO | SSO | https://ads.google.com |\n| Meta Ads Library | Public | N/A | https://www.facebook.com/ads/library |\n\n\ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue201\n\n---\n\n### Scheduling & Meetings\n| Program / App | Username / Email | Password | Login Link |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| Calendly | bethany@theluxoracollective.co | \u26a0\ufe0f Saved | https://calendly.com |\n| Zoom | Bethany account | \u26a0\ufe0f Saved | https://zoom.us |\n| Google Meet | Workspace SSO | SSO | https://meet.google.com |\n\n\ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue201\n\n---\n\n### Contracts & Signatures\n| Program / App | Username / Email | Password | Login Link |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| DocuSign | \u26a0\ufe0f Existing | \u26a0\ufe0f TBD | https://www.docusign.com |\n| Docusel (new) | \u26a0\ufe0f Research in progress | \u26a0\ufe0f TBD | \u26a0\ufe0f TBD |\n\n\ue200filecite\ue202turn0file0\ue201\n\n---\n\n### Notes & Recommendations (Important)\n- This list should become your **single source of truth** until NordPass is fully implemented.\n- I recommend:\n  - **Column-locking passwords**\n  - **Owner column** (Bethany / Eric / Shared)\n  - **Access level column** (Admin / Editor / View)\n- Once NordPass access is finalized, this spreadsheet becomes your **migration reference** only.\n\n---\n\n### Next Step (Optional but Smart)\nIf you want, I can:\n- Convert this into a **Google Sheet**\n- Convert it into a **ClickUp Doc**\n- Format it **exactly for NordPass import**\n- Add a **\u201cNeeds Credentials\u201d task list** for Anchal\n\nJust tell me which format you want next."
